wnee-county"],["ARC or PLC in Pawnee County","/arc-plc/oklahoma/pawnee-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows October to November came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids. In 2025, April to May ran 177% of normal on the middle of the grids, and November to December ran 60%. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 26% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
